        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vmeSGMdFYVut88z35QNr-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B4E74;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Lucida Console&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Isaac Hollaway&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Lucida Console&quot; style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Meylin Borjas&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Lucida Console&quot; style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Elisha Ricketts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="148.14" x="231.86" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vmeSGMdFYVut88z35QNr-4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B4E74;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Lucida Console&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-2efa9735-7fff-be46-1158-4ce436dc0d9c&quot;&gt;The Goal is to create a new 3D Market Place with strong protections for artists work, and technical improvements for the user, and creator experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="190" x="205" y="-260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="OoJCAwJcbpNIT7DrOpCn-3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B4E74;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Lucida Console&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-808d93e5-7fff-aa24-e58f-b0cb4b7ce72d&quot;&gt;Simple and intuitive navigation across all pages. Minimal steps to upload, purchase, or preview assets. Clear labeling of licenses and usage rights. Accessible design for both technical and non-technical users. All fonts will use Woff/Woff 2.0 to save loading time. All images will be in AVIF format to save loading time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="300" x="150" y="-80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vT11Bb8wabiuh0s3Ken0-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B4E74;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Lucida Console&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-1b8d489d-7fff-4387-a0d6-d3886e5062cb&quot;&gt;Users can browse, search, and filter 3D assets efficiently, Artists can upload, update, and manage their assets, Support for multiple file types, Secure purchasing, downloading, and license management, Artist profiles with portfolio, stats, and featured content, System for showcasing new and trending artists&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="370" x="-450" y="-260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Z9o-lfVQxSS0oe_ASw2T-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B4E74;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Lucida Console&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-e824dddb-7fff-2ba2-d02b-7c1254a81d9f&quot;&gt;All 3D marketplaces are currently using artist work to train AI without their permission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="150" x="-10" y="-260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
